        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-lg-7">
                <div class="surface surface-pad">
                    <h2 class="h3">Why we built it</h2>
                    <p>Finding a reliable electrician or tutor still depends on word of mouth. Prices are unclear, people don't turn up, and there's no record of who did a good job. Professionals, meanwhile, spend hours chasing enquiries that never turn into work.</p>
                    <p>Kaarigar puts verified professionals, real availability and honest reviews in one place. Customers see the price and a free time slot before they book. Professionals decide which jobs to accept and get paid for the work they finish.</p>
                    <h2 class="h3 mt-4">How we keep it trustworthy</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Every professional uploads an ID and, where relevant, a trade certificate. An admin reviews them before the profile goes live.</li>
                        <li>Reviews can only be written by the customer of a completed booking, once.</li>
                        <li>Accounts that break the rules can be suspended, and every complaint is answered by a person.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-5">
                <div class="surface surface-pad h-100">
                    <h2 class="h3">About this project</h2>
                    <p class="text-muted">Kaarigar is a university demonstration of a full-stack ASP.NET Core MVC application with SQL Server, Entity Framework Core, a REST API, SQL views and stored procedures. All people, bookings and reviews you see are generated sample data and are marked "Demo" in the admin screens.</p>
